WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:04.477
Mind to Act World. Reasoning and action, evaluated together.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.036
Can strong parts make a reliable whole?

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.473
Mind tracks the task through observations and history.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.209
Act must make the intended physical result happen.

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:26.858
Together, actual outcomes shape what comes next.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:37.744
Intent guides physically valid action. Actual outcomes update what remains, when to act, and which phase comes next.

00:00:48.841 --> 00:00:49.561
Easy.

00:00:50.191 --> 00:00:50.983
Medium.

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:52.244
Hard.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:58.925
Build the benchmark. Test your agents. Let's take the next giant leap together.
